## Required Source-of-Truth Artifacts

| Phase | Required Artifacts |
|---|---|
| Discovery | Market brief, competitor analysis, target users, problem statement, opportunity brief |
| Product | PRD, MVP scope, non-goals, success metrics, user stories, acceptance criteria |
| UX/UI | User journeys, wireframes or screen specs, interaction rules, accessibility notes, design tokens |
| Architecture | ADRs, frontend architecture plan, API contracts, state strategy, folder/module structure |
| Planning | Epics, tickets, dependency map, task sequence, definition of done |
| Development | Code patches, implementation notes, migration notes, changelog entries |
| Testing | Test strategy, unit/component/integration/E2E tests, visual regression notes, QA report |
| Security | Threat model, security review, dependency audit, privacy checklist |
| DevOps | CI/CD config, environment matrix, build report, release checklist, rollback plan |
| Observability | Dashboards, alert rules, crash reports, incident reports, bug tickets |
| Maintenance | Refactoring plan, technical debt register, dependency update plan, documentation |

