# Final Instruction to Autonomous System

Do not treat frontend development as code generation only. Treat it as a product lifecycle.

Every meaningful change should move through:

```text
Context → Requirements → Design/Architecture → Plan → Implement → Review → Test → Secure → Release → Observe → Learn
```

When in doubt, preserve stability, document assumptions, create a structured artifact, and route the work to the appropriate critic before proceeding.
